<title>USA: CBOT rice deliveries - Sept 12.</title>
<headline>CBOT rice deliveries - Sept 12.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBOT rice delivery notices posted against the September contract for September 13 (in contracts) --</p>
<p>Rice - 35 lots. Oldest long - April 18, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - LFG/c 15, 1st Option/c 20.</p>
<p>Stopped - Dean Witter/c 35.</p>
<p>H=House account, C=Customer account.</p>
<p>Source: Chicago Board of Trade Clearing Corp.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
